 "_design": "Overlord dropkick landing tech bounce: f0 contact on back with legs together and arms crossed; f1-f3 squash into ground; f4-f9 rebound rise (+12 cm clip lift over contact, peak at f9-f10) with legs straight and together, arms uncrossing asymmetrically (left f5, right f7) into a balance-bar arc; f10-f17 descent; f18-f19 smoothly blends into frame 0 of GroundHit reaction.",
 "_retime_r1": "r1 2026-11-17: retimed to the game's measured hop (variant2 capture, dropkick_whiff: actor peak 6-7 frames after contact, ground at +12): keys 0,1,2,3,5,7,9,10,13,16,18,19 -> 0,1,2,3,4,6,7,8,10,12,13,14; 15 frames. Poses unchanged; arms L/R keep 2 frames of offset (f4/f6)",
 "_review_r1": "r2 (2026-11-17) from Fable review r1: f0 torso 7 deg flatter + chin tucked; f1-f2 squash (pelvis -4/-5 cm into the floor, heels whip down to ~10 deg, knees give together via feet pulled in 6-8 cm), head back +12 deg at f3; f3-f7 pelvis leads, legs lag, knees straight by f5, ~20 deg at f6; arms come down from f9, GroundHit f0 reached at f11 (held to f14)",
